<p>Hatho pa shaahedee'n ke dam todte hai asghar<br />
Kis yaas o bekasi se dam todte hai asghar</p>

<p>Muh sheh ka waqte aaqir hasrat se dekhte hai<br />
zaahir hai hichkiyo'n se dam todte hai asghar</p>

<p>Gardan se khoo'n rawaa'n hai hoto'n pa nanhi jaa'n hai<br />
Aankhe'n phira phira ke dam todte hai asghar</p>

<p>Ghabra ke nanha syed sheh se lipat gaya hai<br />
baahe'n gale me daale dam todte hai asghar</p>

<p>Dyodi se jab ke poocha bache ka haal maa ne<br />
Rokar kaha ye sheh ne dam todte hai asghar</p>

<p>Aalam hai jaa'n kani ka chehra utar gaya hai<br />
Bekas pidar ke aage dam todte hai asghar</p>

<p>Ghabra rahe hai hazrat qaime me jaake baqir<br />
Bano se koi kehde dam todte hai asghar<br />
</p>